en the data.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.wsj.com/world/pavel-durov-children-fertility-sperm-donation-3d6d5231?mod=hp_lead_pos7\" target=\"_blank\">Russian billionaire has at least one hundred children</a> (WSJ).</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2025/12/23/opinion/gdp-numbers-economy-job-numbers.html\" target=\"_blank\">Jason Furman on the new economic data</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mattsclancy/status/2003483148458623293\" target=\"_blank\">New Substack on abundance and growth</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/tuesday-assorted-links-548.html\">Tuesday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/939213782/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/939213782/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/939213782/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/939213782/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/939213782/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/939213782/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/tuesday-assorted-